(text "3.3 V ONLY\nUse a W25Q128 module exposing IO0-IO3.\nIO2/WP and IO3/HOLD are data in quad mode;\ndo not hard-wire them to supply or ground.\nModule contacts are identified by signal name.\nC7/C8 and R13 may already exist on the module;\nfit them if absent. Keep the QSPI harness short." (at 20.32 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5e612187-5bdc-507b-898f-2f8c4dd1775a"))
(text "SD pins 1-8 use standard card-contact numbering.\nCD switch closes to GND when inserted (advisory input).\nPull-ups on CMD/D0-D3/CD; no pull-up on CLK.\nExisting equivalent module pull-ups/caps need not be duplicated." (at 190.5 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9456ba07-a0e8-51d4-9a9d-d838c0a02c46"))
(embedded_fonts no)
